00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:25.580
So speech-to-text is
part of our conversation

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.480
a group of products
in our building

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:30.960
blocks as part of Cloud AI.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.920
