00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:25.860
We've added 30 new languages.

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:31.260
We're now at 120 languages,
which is mind-boggling,

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:37.920
and a bunch of other features,
like timestamps, punctuation,

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:42.270
